From 2fd7df09516c668f3321b4a523e0d2c66c792fd4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:00:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): route cam.post and MCP post to per-operation files
 when per_op is enabled

Route v_post (backing cam.post and MCP post) through post_per_op when per_op is enabled, and return per-operation file details via PostResult.operations.

Refuse combined-program posting entry points (posting_mounts::single, posting_mounts::post_mounts_with, and posting::stream_records) by name when per_op is true so callers cannot emit a combined file that dropped setup-change stops.

Fixes #2188
